In this Doc the steps are outlines for How we accessed DBR table using Python 
Also how table in DBR cloud is fed to Agent we built to answer questions using Natural language. 

1.	We Will create new Python Project in DBR-SmolAgentsWork
2.  get_gold_data.py - 
	- This cript will connect to Databricks instance.
	- Will read data from GOld level 'fact_orders' table. 
	- Data will be returned to the caller as Pandas Dataframe. 
3. new Agent file 'DBR-Smolagent.py will be created . 
	- This file will have agent created based on InferenceClient of SmolAgent framework. 
	- this agent should answer all questions asked in Natural language. 


